# HLM-10 TDD red — aggregate usage under the root invocation

Date: 2026-11-01
Command: `npx tsx --test --test-name-pattern "aggregate|bound images" packages/tool-mode-recipes/tests/broker.test.ts`

Before implementation: 2 tests, 0 pass, 2 fail.
- "aggregates one attempt, zero images and elapsed time on a text completion":
  `outcome.aggregate` was undefined (`Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'attempts')`).
- "counts bound images in the aggregate": same undefined aggregate.

The broker already carries terminal token usage (`outcome.usage`) and honest unknown,
but not attempts, image count, or elapsed time. The fix adds `BrokerUsageAggregate`
to the completed outcome.
